@startuml k9x_origin_flow
title k9x Origin: one call from an agent

participant Agent
participant "k9x Origin" as O
participant "k9x Shield" as S
participant "Live state\n(memory / Redis)" as ST
participant "System of record\n(MCP / API / SQL)" as SOR

Agent -> O : get_current("claim", "C-1")
O -> O : scope (agent's allowed_entities)
O -> S : screen the request
S --> O : passed
O -> ST : lookup
alt found
  ST --> O : value, as_of, version, source
else not in live state
  O -> SOR : read-through
  SOR --> O : record
  O -> ST : store (history unknown)
end
opt agent is a verify_before step
  O -> SOR : fetch owned fields
  O -> O : compare; disagreement → conflict flag
end
O -> O : attach flags (quarantined, in_review, conflict)
O -> S : screen the answer
O --> Agent : one answer: value, as_of, source, version, flags
note right of Agent
  Business rules (K9RulesAgent) decide on these facts,
  e.g. claim over $5,000 or a conflict → RequiresHIL
end note
@enduml
